# MPR News

> MPR News is Minnesota's premier public radio news organization and the flagship news service of Minnesota Public Radio. As a trusted, non-profit news source serving Minnesota and the Upper Midwest since 1967, we deliver award-winning journalism through comprehensive reporting, investigative stories, and community-focused coverage. Our newsroom provides breaking news, in-depth analysis, live programming, podcasts, and digital content covering state and local politics, government, business, education, health, environment, arts, culture, and sports. With correspondents across Minnesota and partnerships with NPR, we connect local communities to state, national, and international stories that matter to Minnesotans.

